{
  "version": 1,
  "partId": "cam15-t1-p1",
  "audioFile": "cam15-test1-part1.mp3",
  "durationSeconds": 460.245333,
  "method": "whisper-local",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "IELTS 15.",
      "start": 0.37,
      "end": 3.31
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Published by Cambridge University Press and Cambridge Assessment English 2020.",
      "start": 3.31,
      "end": 10.27
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "This recording is copyright.",
      "start": 10.27,
      "end": 13.47
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Test 1.",
      "start": 13.47,
      "end": 16.21
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "This is the IELTS listening test.",
      "start": 16.21,
      "end": 20.05
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You will hear a number of different recordings",
      "start": 20.05,
      "end": 23.03
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.",
      "start": 23.03,
      "end": 27.47
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions",
      "start": 27.47,
      "end": 31.55
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and you will have a chance to check your work.",
      "start": 31.55,
      "end": 35.95
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "All the recordings will be played once only.",
      "start": 35.95,
      "end": 40.79
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The test is in four parts.",
      "start": 40.79,
      "end": 44.05
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes",
      "start": 44.05,
      "end": 48.13
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "to transfer your answers to the answer sheet.",
      "start": 48.13,
      "end": 51.87
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now turn to part 1.",
      "start": 51.87,
      "end": 59.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Part 1.",
      "start": 59.25,
      "end": 61.11
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You will hear a woman phoning a friend to get information about a job agency.",
      "start": 61.11,
      "end": 68.37
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "First, you have some time to look at questions 1 to 5.",
      "start": 68.37,
      "end": 97.55
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now listen carefully and answer questions 1 to 5.",
      "start": 97.55,
      "end": 106.38
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "This is Amber.",
      "start": 106.38,
      "end": 108.12
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You said to phone if I wanted to get more information",
      "start": 108.12,
      "end": 111.86
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "about the job agency you mentioned.",
      "start": 111.86,
      "end": 114.6
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Is now a good time.",
      "start": 114.6,
      "end": 116.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Hi Amber. Yes, fine.",
      "start": 116.36,
      "end": 119.76
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So the agency I was talking about is called Bankside.",
      "start": 119.76,
      "end": 123.16
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They're based in Docklands.",
      "start": 123.16,
      "end": 124.68
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I can tell you the address now.",
      "start": 124.68,
      "end": 127.06
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "497 Eastside.",
      "start": 127.06,
      "end": 128.68
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay, thanks.",
      "start": 128.68,
      "end": 130.6
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So is there anyone in particular I should speak to you there?",
      "start": 130.6,
      "end": 134.72
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The agent I always deal with is called Becky Jamison.",
      "start": 134.72,
      "end": 138.5
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Let me write that down.",
      "start": 138.5,
      "end": 140.76
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Becky Jamison.",
      "start": 140.76,
      "end": 142.72
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "J-A-M-I-E-S-O-N.",
      "start": 142.72,
      "end": 149.9
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Do you have her direct line?",
      "start": 149.9,
      "end": 152.72
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, it's in my contact somewhere.",
      "start": 152.72,
      "end": 155.82
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Right, here we are.",
      "start": 155.82,
      "end": 157.64
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-37",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "078-26-510-3.",
      "start": 157.64,
      "end": 162.68
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-38",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't call her until the afternoon if I were you.",
      "start": 162.68,
      "end": 166.42
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-39",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "She's always really busy in the morning trying to fill last minute vacancies.",
      "start": 166.42,
      "end": 170.32
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-40",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "She's really helpful and friendly so I'm sure it would be worth getting in touch with her for an informal chat.",
      "start": 170.32,
      "end": 177.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-41",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's mainly clerical and admin jobs they deal with, isn't it?",
      "start": 177.36,
      "end": 181.02
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-42",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's right.",
      "start": 181.02,
      "end": 182.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-43",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I know you're hoping to find a full-time job in the media eventually",
      "start": 182.36,
      "end": 186.78
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-44",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "but Becky mostly recruits temporary staff for the finance sector",
      "start": 186.78,
      "end": 189.38
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-45",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "which will look good on your CV and generally pays better too.",
      "start": 189.38,
      "end": 193.94
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-46",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yeah, I'm just a bit worried because I don't have much office experience.",
      "start": 193.94,
      "end": 198.78
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-47",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't worry.",
      "start": 198.78,
      "end": 200.66
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-48",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "They'll probably start you as a receptionist or something like that.",
      "start": 200.66,
      "end": 204.4
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-49",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So what's important for that kind of job isn't so much having business skills",
      "start": 204.4,
      "end": 208.94
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-50",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "or knowing lots of different computer systems.",
      "start": 208.94,
      "end": 211.56
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-51",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's communication that really matters so you'd be fine there.",
      "start": 211.56,
      "end": 215.46
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-52",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And you'll pick up office skills really quickly on the job.",
      "start": 215.46,
      "end": 219.2
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-53",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's not that complicated.",
      "start": 219.2,
      "end": 220.1
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-54",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay, good.",
      "start": 220.1,
      "end": 221.92
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-55",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So how long do people generally need temporary staff for?",
      "start": 221.92,
      "end": 225.72
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-56",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It would be great if I could get something lasting at least a month.",
      "start": 225.72,
      "end": 230.56
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-57",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That shouldn't be too difficult.",
      "start": 230.56,
      "end": 232.34
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-58",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "But you're more likely to be offered something for a week at first",
      "start": 232.34,
      "end": 236.76
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-59",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "which might get extended.",
      "start": 236.76,
      "end": 237.16
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-60",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's unusual to be sent somewhere for just a day or two.",
      "start": 237.16,
      "end": 241.24
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-61",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Right.",
      "start": 241.24,
      "end": 241.69
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-62",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I've heard the pay isn't too bad.",
      "start": 241.69,
      "end": 243.88
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-63",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Better than working in a shop or a restaurant.",
      "start": 243.88,
      "end": 246.94
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-64",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh yes, definitely.",
      "start": 246.94,
      "end": 248.38
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-65",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The hourly rate is about £10.11 if you're lucky.",
      "start": 248.38,
      "end": 251.98
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-66",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That's pretty good.",
      "start": 251.98,
      "end": 253.08
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-67",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I was only expecting to get eight or nine pounds an hour.",
      "start": 253.08,
      "end": 260.83
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-68",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the conversation,",
      "start": 260.83,
      "end": 263.77
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-69",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "you have some time to look at questions six to ten.",
      "start": 263.77,
      "end": 292.5
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-70",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Now listen and answer questions six to ten.",
      "start": 292.5,
      "end": 299.22
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-71",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Do you want me to tell you anything about the registration process?",
      "start": 299.22,
      "end": 303.3
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-72",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, please.",
      "start": 303.3,
      "end": 304.14
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-73",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I know you have to have an interview.",
      "start": 304.14,
      "end": 306.86
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-74",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The interview usually takes about an hour",
      "start": 306.86,
      "end": 308.88
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-75",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "and you should arrange that about a week in advance.",
      "start": 308.88,
      "end": 311.78
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-76",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I suppose I should dress smartly if it's for office work.",
      "start": 311.78,
      "end": 315.34
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-77",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I can probably borrow a suit from Mum.",
      "start": 315.34,
      "end": 318.8
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-78",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Good idea.",
      "start": 318.8,
      "end": 319.86
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-79",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's better to look too smart than too casual.",
      "start": 319.86,
      "end": 323.32
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-80",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Will I need to bring copies of my exam certificates or anything like that?",
      "start": 323.32,
      "end": 328.12
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-81",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "No, they don't need to see those, I don't think.",
      "start": 328.12,
      "end": 331.52
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-82",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "What about my passport?",
      "start": 331.52,
      "end": 332.86
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-83",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Oh yes, they will ask to see that.",
      "start": 332.86,
      "end": 335.58
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-84",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start": 335.58,
      "end": 336.3
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-85",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't get stressed about the interview there.",
      "start": 336.3,
      "end": 339.02
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-86",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's just a chance for them to build a relationship with you",
      "start": 339.02,
      "end": 342.44
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-87",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "so they can try and match you to a job which you'll like.",
      "start": 342.44,
      "end": 345.68
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-88",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "So there are questions about personality",
      "start": 345.68,
      "end": 346.72
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-89",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "that they always ask candidates, fairly basic ones.",
      "start": 346.72,
      "end": 350.6
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-90",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And they probably won't ask anything too difficult",
      "start": 350.6,
      "end": 353.32
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-91",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "like what your plans are for the future.",
      "start": 353.32,
      "end": 356.38
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-92",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Hope not.",
      "start": 356.38,
      "end": 358.04
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-93",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Anyway, there are lots of benefits to using an agency.",
      "start": 358.04,
      "end": 362.1
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-94",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "For example, the interview will be useful",
      "start": 362.1,
      "end": 364.48
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-95",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "because they'll give you feedback on your performance",
      "start": 364.48,
      "end": 366.8
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-96",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "so you can improve next time.",
      "start": 366.8,
      "end": 368.82
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-97",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And they'll have access to jobs which aren't advertised.",
      "start": 368.82,
      "end": 372.74
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-98",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start": 372.74,
      "end": 373.92
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-99",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Most temporary jobs aren't advertised.",
      "start": 373.92,
      "end": 376.64
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-100",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "And I expect finding a temporary job this way",
      "start": 376.64,
      "end": 379.7
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-101",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "takes a lot less time.",
      "start": 379.7,
      "end": 382.12
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-102",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "It's much easier than ringing up individual companies.",
      "start": 382.12,
      "end": 385.92
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-103",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Yes, indeed.",
      "start": 385.92,
      "end": 387.12
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-104",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Well, I think I've covered it.",
      "start": 387.12,
      "end": 392.36
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-105",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "That is the end of part one.",
      "start": 392.36,
      "end": 395.44
    },
    {
      "id": "cue-106",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You now have one minute to check your answers to part one.",
      "start": 395.44,
      "end": 460.245
    }
  ]
}
